While analysing, you wrote the check below. What does it print when it runs?

```
const derlem = ["robot sağa döner .", "sensör sağa gider ."]
const uretilen = "robot sağa gider ."
const tam = derlem.includes(uretilen)
const k = uretilen.split(" ")
const ciftler = k.slice(0, -1).map((x, i) => x + " " + k[i + 1])
const hepsiVar = ciftler.every((c) => derlem.some((s) => s.includes(c)))
console.log(tam, hepsiVar)
